═════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
§ THEORETICAL-NOTES ← §§ T26-depth-hints
═════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
  SMT solvers :
    Z3 (Microsoft Research) : de Moura + Bjørner 2008 • fastest-QF
    CVC5 (Stanford + Iowa)  : Barrett et al. 2022 • stronger-non-linear
    Alt-Ergo : alt-choice for non-linear+quantifier
    recommend Z3-primary + CVC5-fallback ∵ coverage complementary
  SMT-LIB2 vs C-API :
    C-API : fast • complex-build • version-coupling
    SMT-LIB2 stdio : portable • slight-overhead • version-loose
    recommend stdio ∵ simpler-integration + audit-trail-natural
  Theories :
    LIA (linear integer arith) : decidable • fast
    LRA (linear real arith) : decidable • fast
    NIA (non-linear int) : undecidable in-general • heuristics help
    NRA (non-linear real) : decidable via CAD • slow
    UF (uninterpreted functions) : decidable • useful for abstraction
    Array : decidable • extensional/nonextensional variants
    BV (bit-vectors) : decidable • good for fixed-width integers
  Refinement-discharge strategies :
    eager : discharge-at-binding-site • fast-feedback
    lazy : collect-all + batch-discharge • better-caching
    hybrid : eager-at-fn-boundaries + lazy-internals
    recommend lazy + batched ∵ cache-friendliness
  Morpheme formalization :
    most morphemes → UF predicates (opaque but reasoning-friendly)
    durative/perfective → numeric predicates on duration
    generic → quantifier-introduction (∀α)
    reflexive → equality-on-projection
  Proof certs :
    LFSC (LF with Side Conditions) : Z3 can emit
    DRAT : for propositional parts
    Alethe : CVC5 emits
    recommend : store-result + canonical-formula (lightweight-cert)
    full-cert : future-work • Isabelle/Coq-replay
  Undecidable-handling :
    timeout → Unknown • document + move-on
    user-guided : @proof annotation with manual-lemma (future)
    abstraction-refinement : CEGAR-style (future)

